<title>USA: ShoLodge to repurchase Shoney's warrant.</title>
<headline>ShoLodge to repurchase Shoney's warrant.</headline>
<dateline>GALLATIN, Tenn. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>ShoLodge Inc said on Friday that it has an agreement with Shoneys Inc whereby ShoLodge will repurchase for $2,050,000 the warrant held by Shoney's to acquire five percent of the company's stock.</p>
<p>ShoLodge also said that under this agreement, it will pay Shoney's $5,250,000 to cancel the future obligations to pay a portion of the franchisee fees generated by the Shoney's Inn chain (currently 89 inns) to Shoney's.</p>
<p>The fees paid to Shoney's currently amount to $1.1 million annually, the company said.</p>
</text>
